<title>PORTUGAL: BPSM share trade interrupted on Lisbon bourse.</title>
<headline>BPSM share trade interrupted on Lisbon bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares in Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor were interrupted temporarily on the Lisbon bourse, dealers said.</p>
<p>The reason for the interruption was not immediately known.</p>
<p>BPSM shares hit a high for 1997 of 1,298 escudos earlier today.</p>
</text>
